SUMMARY:Arabic Type Course
DESCRIPTION:Throughout this 4-day immersive course\, designers\, design students\, calligraphers\, educators and creatives passionate about Arabic typography and its modern applications are welcome to explore Arabic type design by merging traditional calligraphy with digital tools. Participants will study Arabic script history\, develop hand-drawing skills and transform their sketches into digital type compositions. The final outcome is a fully realized Arabic type poster reflecting both cultural depth and modern design. Course Objectives: Understanding the historical and stylistic context of Arabic type Developing practical skills in Arabic letter drawing Learning techniques utilized in digital glyph constr
LOCATION:Ithra Tower - Level 8\, Classroom 2
